5. Production Privacy Must Be "Opt-In" by Default
Capturing raw prompt and completion strings (gen_ai.input.messages) poses a serious threat for PII leakage and ballooning telemetry storage costs. In production environments, rely heavily on External Payload Referencing (storing the raw text in an encrypted, short-retention object store like S3 and putting a simple reference URL on the OTel span attributes) rather than dumping raw inputs directly onto the trace spans.






